3. Example detection ideas
Brute force: many 4625 events for one account (or from one IP) in a short time, followed by a 4624 success.
Backdoor admin: 4720 followed within minutes by 4732 for the same account.
Hiding tracks: 1102 appearing right after suspicious activity.
Persistence: 7045 or 4697 with a service name or file path that is not normal for the company.
Remember: know three groups. Logons: 4624, 4625, 4634, 4648, 4672, 4768, 4769, 4776. Accounts: 4720, 4722, 4724, 4732. System changes: 4688, 4697, 1102.


